#: input/pagecontent/testing.md:33
msgid "<a0>Docker</a0> installed locally"
msgstr "تثبيت <a0>Docker</a0> محليًا"

#: input/pagecontent/testing.md:15
msgid "As FHIR resources in this ImplementationGuide - these are used in the test cases"
